WEBVTT

00:12:58.899 --> 00:13:01.401
They tell me that they feel
tired and foolish,

00:13:01.401 --> 00:13:04.947
and sometimes, they even say
that they feel like they're done.

00:13:06.198 --> 00:13:09.451
We try not to make this process
any harder for them.

00:13:10.536 --> 00:13:14.790
As in, "Wow, you've really been
through a lot ...

00:13:14.832 --> 00:13:17.084
But wait, there's more."

00:13:18.085 --> 00:13:20.879
And we get to share
in their amazing resiliency

00:13:20.921 --> 00:13:22.089
and their humor,

00:13:22.089 --> 00:13:26.343
as we navigate our way
through this messy system together.

00:13:27.469 --> 00:13:30.973
We can improve how the system responds
to their mistreatment.